---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy & Terms | Zain Group of Companies" 
  description="Privacy policy and terms of service for Zain Group of Companies. Understand how we collect, use, and protect your information when booking property in Karachi."
>
  <section class="bg-linen py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-charcoal/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center space-y-4">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-accent-gold block">Legal Documents</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light font-display text-charcoal max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-tight">
        Privacy Policy & Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-charcoal/50 max-w-lg mx-auto font-light">
        Last updated: July 28, 2026. Please read our guidelines and privacy policies regarding property bookings and website usage.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 font-light text-charcoal space-y-12 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    
    {/* Privacy Policy Block */}
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-light font-display text-charcoal uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-charcoal/10 pb-2">1. Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        At Zain Group of Companies (ZGC), we prioritize the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information we collect, record, and how we utilize it.
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-charcoal/90 mt-4">Information We Collect</h3>
      <p>
        When you use our contact form or newsletter subscription field, we ask for personal details:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-charcoal/80">
        <li><strong>Name:</strong> To identify you and personalize our communications.</li>
        <li><strong>Phone Number:</strong> To connect you with our real estate sales representatives.</li>
        <li><strong>Email Address:</strong> To respond to inquiries and send newsletter updates.</li>
        <li><strong>Message Details:</strong> To understand your specific property requirements.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-charcoal/90 mt-4">How We Use Your Data</h3>
      <p>
        ZGC uses the collected information to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-charcoal/80">
        <li>Provide, operate, and maintain our website services.</li>
        <li>Improve, personalize, and expand our website user experiences.</li>
        <li>Understand and analyze how you interact with our pages.</li>
        <li>Communicate with you regarding bookings, project status, and newsletter campaigns.</li>
        <li>Optimize advertising campaigns using marketing tools like Facebook Pixel.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-charcoal/90 mt-4">Cookies and Analytics</h3>
      <p>
        Our website uses standard cookies to enable features. We implement third-party analytics and tracking tools:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-charcoal/80">
        <li><strong>Facebook Pixel:</strong> Track conversion actions to improve target ads (Pixel ID: 1217734245532112).</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> Gather anonymous statistics regarding visits, pages viewed, and bounce rate.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    {/* Terms of Service Block */}
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-light font-display text-charcoal uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-charcoal/10 pb-2">2. Terms of Service</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing this website, we assume you accept these terms of service in full. Do not continue to use Zain Group of Companies' website if you do not agree to all terms stated.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-charcoal/90 mt-4">Property Booking Conditions</h3>
      <p>
        All project pricing, area dimensions, room counts, and completion timelines displayed on this website are sourced from ZGC's construction records. While we aim to maintain absolute accuracy:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-charcoal/80">
        <li>Installment and payment plans are subject to changes based on market conditions or developer guidelines.</li>
        <li>Official bookings are confirmed only after signing the physical booking file and paying the initial amount at our Malir head office.</li>
        <li>Information on under-construction projects remains subject to regulatory completions by the Sindh Building Control Authority (SBCA).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-charcoal/90 mt-4">Intellectual Property</h3>
      <p>
        Unless otherwise stated, Zain Group of Companies and/or its licensors own the intellectual property rights for all material on ZGC. All intellectual property rights are reserved. You must not copy, sell, or redistribute website assets, rendering blueprints, or copy blocks without ZGC's written approval.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>
</BaseLayout>
